  <jpcrp030000-asr_E03693-000:NotesRegardingAccountsReceivableOperatingLoansTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_NonConsolidatedMember">&lt;p class="smt_head6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;※５　営業貸付金のうち個人向無担保貸付金の額&lt;/p&gt;
